WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.470
 [VOCALIZING] (SINGING) E.
[LAUGHS] 

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.300
(SPEAKING) Instead of (SINGING) E. 

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.280
I'm Christina Aguilera.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.530
Over the next 30 days,
I'm going to walk

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.330
you step by step
through what it takes

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.960
to be a great singer, including
a personal warm-up routine I've

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.706
crafted just for you.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.100
[VOCALIZING]

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:27.700
You'll learn my best techniques
for elevating your singing

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:30.310
and stage presence, how
to emotionally connect

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:33.040
to what you're singing,
what to listen for in a song

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:36.370
and make it your own, and
lastly, how to develop a vision

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:39.370
and perform a song
that is truly yours.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:42.040
Everything should just
be a feeling and a flow.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:44.260
You're going to walk away
knowing how to perform

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.810
your own rendition of a song.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.036
[LAUGHS]

00:00:48.036 --> 00:00:50.327
[MUSIC PLAYING]

